'''Imperial Court''' (まろはネコでおじゃる, ''Maro wa Neko de Ojaru'', '''I Am a Cat''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Effect==
"Strong" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

